From: PowOS <noreply@powback.com>
Subject: [PATCH] backends/anland: a keyboard already up moves to a window task's own consumer when it goes live

The task's "ime" arrives before it is live (ownKeyboard() needs Live), so a keyboard its text field asked for as
the window opened (System Settings' search) stayed on the desktop's consumer and KWin counted it shown: tapping
the field raised nothing. goLive() decides the keyboard's place again.
---
diff --git a/src/backends/anland/anland_window_task.cpp b/src/backends/anland/anland_window_task.cpp
index d5b6142..f8c02a2 100644
--- a/src/backends/anland/anland_window_task.cpp
+++ b/src/backends/anland/anland_window_task.cpp
@@ -433,6 +433,12 @@ void AnlandWindowTask::goLive()
         ev.keyboard.visible = 1;
         push_output_event(m_display, &ev);
     }
+    // PowOS (kwin 0054): a keyboard already up goes to this task's own consumer now that it is live. Its "ime" came
+    // before (ownKeyboard() needs Live), so the keyboard System Settings' search asked for as it opened stayed on the
+    // desktop's consumer (often none behind a web window) and KWin counted it shown: a tap on the field raised nothing.
+    if (m_ownKeyboard && m_tasks && m_tasks->backend()) {
+        m_tasks->backend()->refreshConsumerKeyboard("task live");
+    }
 
     if (!m_window) {
         return;
@@ -1255,7 +1261,9 @@ void AnlandWindowTasks::announce()
 {
     // What this KWin understands beyond "closed"/"focus": the app only sends it then (an older KWin, buffers of the
     // task's size as before).
-    send({QStringLiteral("caps"), QStringLiteral("size export-new fullscreen session desktop decor move maximize minimize nodecor quit window-ime fullscreen-request parent moveresize ownframe")});
+    // keyboard-live (kwin 0054): a keyboard asked for before a task went live moves to its consumer, so the app may
+    // hold an ask no touch came before (TapKeyboard) - an older KWin never re-sends it and a tap would raise nothing.
+    send({QStringLiteral("caps"), QStringLiteral("size export-new fullscreen session desktop decor move maximize minimize nodecor quit window-ime fullscreen-request parent moveresize ownframe keyboard-live")});
     // Which KWin this is and the tasks it shows now (window ids restart at 1 with each KWin): the app finishes every
     // window task of an earlier KWin, or one this KWin no longer has, instead of showing a new window in it (after a
     // session restart, Kate's launcher tap raised the old session's dead Kate task).
